"default)"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid "nb-countries"
msgstr "nb-countries"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The number of countries (42 in the default skin). There should be the same "
"number of country groups below"
msgstr ""
"O número de países (42 na aparencia predeterminada). Debería haber o mesmo "
"número de grupos de países de embaixo"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid "nb-nationalities"
msgstr "nb-nationalities"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The number of nationalities (6 in the default skin). There should be the "
